		   Click, Enter, or Space then closes the hint, goes back to the first page, and plays it again. #}
		<div class="scene" id="heroScene" role="button" tabindex="0" title="Play again"
			aria-label="ScreenHint in action: a keyboard shortcut tints the screen, a figure in an app window is selected and becomes a floating hint, the hint is dragged beside the window and stays in view while the app moves on to another page. Press to play again.">
